      "body": "Complete — merged via the merge queue as PR #90 (mergedAt 2026-07-23T04:57:00Z).\n\nDoD evidence: (1) Manifest committed with corpus CID blake3:194db0ee..., SPDX CC-BY-SA-4.0 + attribution, 3,000 articles, and the deterministic split rule (blake3(id)[0] % 5 == 0, ~20% held-out). (2) From-text observation driver (observe_text.rs) produces format-identical v3 records teacher-forced via the shared encoder; content-addressed sample IDs and resumable shards per the pipeline's T-invariance rules; per-article atomic checkpoints converge to the exact single-pass merged κ on resume (crash-tested). (3) Smoke run on 10 sealed-corpus articles: 2,331 records, 16 shards, 1819 construction / 512 held-out records (8/2 articles ≈ 20% — matching the rule, independently recounted); merged κ blake3:7ba60de6...; rerun wrote 0 bytes. (4) Verified in a clean detached worktree: 47 suites, clippy -D warnings, fmt clean; PR checks all green; merged through the queue. The natural partition of D3 is now real data; #75 (HF-path full Gate C on D3) and #73 (larger-teacher ceiling) are unblocked.",
